        <h1>Cancellation &amp; Refund Policy</h1>

        <p class="legal-intro">
            This policy explains cancellations and refunds on ShiftingGuru, a business owned and run by
            Rahul Goyal as a sole proprietor, at Shop No. 6, Bhardwaj Complex, near Pareena Laxmi Apartment,
