        <h2>1. Customers</h2>
        <p>Asking for quotes on ShiftingGuru is free. We do not charge customers anything.</p>
        <p>
            You pay the partner you choose directly, on the terms agreed with them. ShiftingGuru does not
            collect payment for the move, so refunds for a move are between you and the partner.
        </p>
        <p>
            If you need to cancel or change a booking, tell the partner as early as you can. They may charge for
            work already done, or keep an advance, as agreed with them. If you cannot reach an agreement, contact
            us and we will try to help.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Partners: the registration fee</h2>
        <p>Partners pay a one-time registration fee of &#8377;229 when they apply to join ShiftingGuru.</p>
        <p>
            <strong>If we reject your application, we refund the fee in full.</strong> You do not need to
            ask - we start the refund when we tell you about the decision.
        </p>
        <p>
            Once your application is approved, the fee is not refundable. That includes if you later stop using
            ShiftingGuru, or if your account is paused or closed for breaking our
            <a href="/terms">Terms &amp; Conditions</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
            If you were charged twice by mistake, or paid without your application being saved, contact us and
            we will refund the extra payment.
        </p>

        <h2>3. How refunds are paid</h2>
        <p>
            Refunds go back to the same card, UPI or bank account you paid with, through our payment provider,
